    featuredImagePrompt: "A powerful industry-specific visual depicting the convergence of geopolitical conflict and economic turmoil. Show a stylized global map with overlapping US and Iran flags, surrounded by abstract representations of falling stock market graphs (red downward arrows), rising oil derricks, and intricate digital financial data flows. Emphasize the interconnectedness of global markets and the energy sector, showcasing a busy oil terminal or refinery in the background. Use a dominant color palette of deep reds, oranges, and dark blues to convey urgency and crisis, with subtle golden accents highlighting the oil element. The composition should be dynamic, modern, and suitable for a news editorial, focusing on the broad industry impact rather than just direct war imagery. Avoid showing explicit weaponry or violence.",
