    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split composition. On one side, a sophisticated graphic representation of a stock market ticker with 'Purple Style Labs' and 'IPO' prominently displayed, alongside an upward-trending arrow. The background in this section features subtle abstract patterns hinting at digital finance. On the other side, an elegant, vibrant illustration of a diverse group of fashion-conscious individuals browsing high-fashion apparel on various digital devices (tablet, phone), set against a backdrop that subtly blends traditional Indian architectural elements (like an archway) with modern, minimalist retail aesthetics. The overall tone should be professional, aspirational, and reflect the blend of technology, finance, and fashion unique to India's D2C boom. Incorporate subtle national colors (saffron, green, white) or motifs without being overtly patriotic. High contrast, clean lines, and a sense of dynamic growth. Focus on visual storytelling for a news article, ensuring a unique composition different from generic stock photos or previous conceptual visuals.",
