    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, abstract visual representing the global reach and economic power of the IPL. A stylized cricket ball, glowing with energy, orbits a translucent, interconnected globe. Streaks of data and light emanate from the ball, connecting major cities in India, the United States, United Kingdom, Canada, and Australia. Integrated subtly into the globe are upward-trending financial graphs and digital broadcasting elements (e.g., pixelated patterns, network nodes). The background is a soft blur of vibrant stadium lights and diverse, silhouette fan profiles from different continents, conveying a sense of unity and excitement. The overall aesthetic is futuristic, energetic, and visually compelling, using a rich palette of blues, greens, and gold, emphasizing convergence and expansion.",
