    featuredImagePrompt: "A panoramic, realistic environmental shot depicting the dual impact of 'Super El Niño' and climate change. In the foreground, a parched, cracked earth landscape with struggling dry crops under an intense, hazy sun, symbolizing drought and heatwaves. In the mid-ground, a vibrant, well-irrigated field in India, showcasing resilience with green, healthy crops, perhaps with a farmer tending to them, illustrating adaptation. In the distant background, subtle signs of environmental stress like distant smoke from wildfires or a slightly ominous sky. The composition should convey both global crisis and localized hope/preparedness, avoiding any stock photo clichés. Focus on natural light and a slightly desaturated color palette for the drought areas contrasting with the lush green of the resilient field.",
