    featuredImagePrompt: "A futuristic, conceptual visual representing the multifaceted nature of Artificial Intelligence. The image should blend abstract elements of neural networks and data streams with symbols of financial growth (subtle upward graphs or digital currency representations) and global regulation (stylized scales of justice or interwoven digital borders). Incorporate subtle nods to a global context with interconnected light trails, avoiding specific flags but conveying worldwide reach. The overall aesthetic should be sophisticated, slightly abstract, and convey both innovation and oversight. Focus on a dynamic composition with a sense of forward motion. The color palette should be modern, using blues, greens, and purples with bright accents.",
