      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There\'s a moderate probability (45%) of a neutral-to-slightly bullish outcome, where the PAC\'s actions contribute to a more nuanced view of crypto\'s role in sustainability, potentially leading to some favorable policy shifts in green tech. A significant bullish outcome (30%) relies on sustained, broad positive public perception and a lack of severe political backlash. A bearish outcome (25%) is plausible if the \'retribution\' aspect leads to aggressive counter-measures from political opponents, resulting in negative regulatory impacts on the broader crypto market.",
