      vestingAnalysis: "For Zcash itself, there isn\'t a traditional vesting schedule for an initial token sale. The ZEC supply is released via mining. For Cypherpunk\'s acquisition, the $33.3 million deal implies a direct investment into mining infrastructure and ZEC acquisition rather than a token vesting schedule for a project launch. For institutional assets on Canton Network, specific vesting or lock-up periods would be determined by the underlying tokenized asset\'s structure and regulatory requirements, not a native token vesting.",
