      onChainMetrics: "On-chain metrics for Bitcoin (e.g., active addresses, transaction count, miner revenue, holding patterns) provide insights into network health, adoption trends, and investor behavior, often indicating accumulation or distribution phases.",
      whaleActivity: "Movements by \'whales\' (large Bitcoin holders) are closely watched as they can indicate significant shifts in market sentiment or potential price action, with large accumulations often seen as bullish signals.",
      institutionalAdoption: "Institutional adoption of Bitcoin has surged, evidenced by the launch of spot ETFs, increasing corporate treasury allocations, and traditional financial institutions offering custody and trading services for digital assets.",
