      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "Our probability-weighted outlook suggests a \'cautiously optimistic\' near-term for Bitcoin (60% likelihood of moderate upside, 30% neutral, 10% downside), driven by ETF inflows and macro tailwinds. For the broader altcoin market, the outlook is \'bearish to neutral\' (45% downside, 40% neutral, 15% upside), given the ongoing shakeout and regulatory uncertainty. The long-term outlook remains positive for fundamentally strong projects, contingent on evolving regulatory clarity and a continued shift towards utility-driven models.",
